  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>At California Miramar University (CMU), you'll get an education that focuses on innovation and practical learning. CMU is an AI-first and STEM-focused university, and offers you courses with a specialised focus in Artificial Intelligence. The School of Business has a range of degrees, including the Bachelor of Science in Business Administration (BSBA) and Master of Business Administration (MBA).</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>At CMU, you’ll be part of a diverse and inclusive community, with students from over 30 countries. The university helps you when you're settling in. They offer international student orientation, academic advising, and programs to make you feel at home.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>The university does not provide on-campus housing. However, CMU helps you find suitable off-campus living arrangements in the San Diego area.</p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><i>If you’re looking for budget-friendly accommodation options outside the campus, feel free to </i><a href=\"https://edvoy.com/app/\"><i>download our app</i></a><i> and check out the Stays feature!</i></p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Library</strong><br>CMU's library offers a comprehensive collection of books, academic journals, and research databases to support your studies. Quiet individual and group study areas are also available.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
